# 490 Life

> Weekly Bible teachings, resources for the Christian life, and the book *Seventy Times Seven* by David S. Jones — on the God who forgives past all counting. The name comes from Matthew 18:22: Jesus' command to forgive "seventy times seven."

Author and site owner: David S. Jones (Arizona, USA). Contact: david@490.life.

## The Book

- [Seventy Times Seven]({{ site.url }}/seventy-times-seven/): "Seventy Times Seven: On the God Who Forgives Past All Counting" — Christian living / forgiveness. ISBN 979-8-9969382-1-6, published by 490 Life Publishing, available on Amazon (paperback, hardcover, Kindle).

